    "text": "Given to players at the Burning Shadows prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 22–23 and 29–30 July 2017. Each kit held four Burning Shadows booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Burning Shadows logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Vileplume and Rhyperior, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
